    "name": "National Land Cover",
    "description": [
      "Abstract:",
      "This data set is one complete raster coverage of the MRLC National Land Cover Data (NLCD) covering the conterminous United States. The NLCD is composed of 16-classes, and is derived from Landsat 7 Enhanced Thematic Mapper, and Landsat 5 satellite data centered around 2001. A complete description of these data can be found at http://www.mrlc.gov/nlcd.php."
    ],
